# Fast Schlager: 5 verses, 2 pre-choruses, 6 choruses and 2 bridges in long notes for the "schlager" style at 120-129 bpm.
# Key of C major / A minor, sung pitch (C4 = middle C). Half notes, whole notes and ties; at most about 2.9 notes a bar.

